      "en": "but Abraham gave gifts to the sons of Abraham’s concubines. While he still lived, he sent them away from Isaac his son, eastward, to the east country.",
      "ko": "자기 서자들에게도 재물을 주어 자기 생전에 그들로 자기 아들 이삭을 떠나 동방 곧 동국으로 가게 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8faaa000a2bc338106ee2d2a3ac5685102e68f6f7bff31391fcd4e2c1481e8d2",
      "translation_text_hash": "48e5bc09ccfb95c5c9c6115bd40dedd8602c82e61ecb1a2dd0fdc19a99c0d37d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
