      "en": "These are the sons of Ishmael, and these are their names, by their villages, and by their encampments: twelve princes, according to their nations.",
      "ko": "이들은 이스마엘의 아들들이요 그 촌과 부락대로 된 이름이며 그 족속대로는 십 이 방백이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "eca929445a5157795e816c49df50c47105d79edf521c82d8ba8b97f7ba7badd7",
      "translation_text_hash": "86b30230ecafb9139ca05db68dd4b075674f6b6b4b6020409de6edc4c0cd5364",
