      "en": "These are the years of the life of Ishmael: one hundred thirty-seven years. He gave up his spirit and died, and was gathered to his people.",
      "ko": "이스마엘은 향년이 일백 삼십 칠세에 기운이 진하여 죽어 자기 열조에게로 돌아갔고",
      "source_text_hash": "6ea365c1da06549db63cc1c686d0cfbb1c09cadd498c1f7fb8b38517f8ca4971",
      "translation_text_hash": "efe076fc7fc79f055fb24139c50a4f39bb1d83c0f6d20c849c72f5995332d433",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이스마엘은 향년이 일백 삼십 칠세에 기운이 진하여 죽어 자기 열조에게로 돌아갔고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "efe076fc7fc79f055fb24139c50a4f39bb1d83c0f6d20c849c72f5995332d433"
      ]
    },
